          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="99792_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="No">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">95725</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <setvar action="Set" varname="SCORE">100</setvar>
        </respcondition>
      </resprocessing>
      <itemfeedback ident="95725_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Organizing research and ideas is Step 4, which comes immediately before drafting your paper in Step 5. During this step, you decide which sources to cite and confirm that your evidence supports your thesis before you begin writing.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="307_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Choosing a topic is Step 1, conducting research is Step 3, and planning and scheduling is Step 2. These all occur earlier in the process. The steps must be completed in order because each one prepares you for the next. You cannot draft effectively until your research has been gathered and organized.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="51147_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Choosing a topic is Step 1, conducting research is Step 3, and planning and scheduling is Step 2. These all occur earlier in the process. The steps must be completed in order because each one prepares you for the next. You cannot draft effectively until your research has been gathered and organized.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="99792_fb">
